#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.desktop.in:2
msgid "Desktop Files Editor"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.desktop.in:8
msgid "Desktop;Files;Editor;"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.gschema.xml:6
msgid "Show hidden applications"
msgstr "Afficher les applications cachées"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Manage your .desktop files"
msgstr "Gérer vos fichiers .desktop"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Every application in your launcher is described by a .desktop file. Desktop "
"Files Editor gathers them in one list, so you can change them without "
"searching through folders or editing text files by hand."
msgstr ""
"Chaque application de votre lanceur est décrite par un fichier .desktop. "
"Desktop Files Editor les réunit dans une seule liste, pour les modifier sans "
"fouiller dans des dossiers ni éditer des fichiers texte à la main."

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Your user, system and Flatpak applications are all listed. System files are "
"never modified: when you change one, a copy is saved in your personal "
"folder, and you can restore the original at any time."
msgstr ""
"Vos applications personnelles, système et Flatpak sont toutes listées. Les "
"fichiers système ne sont jamais modifiés : lorsque vous en changez un, une "
"copie est enregistrée dans votre dossier personnel, et vous pouvez restaurer "
"l’original à tout moment."

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Fonctionnalités :"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid "Browse and search all your applications"
msgstr "Parcourir et rechercher toutes vos applications"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:15
msgid "Edit the name, icon, comment and command of an application"
msgstr ""
"Modifier le nom, l’icône, le commentaire et la commande d’une application"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid "Hide applications from your launcher, and show them again"
msgstr "Cacher des applications de votre lanceur, puis les réafficher"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid "Create new applications"
msgstr "Créer de nouvelles applications"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Delete your own applications or restore the original ones, with undo"
msgstr ""
"Supprimer vos applications ou restaurer les originales, avec possibilité "
"d’annuler"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid "Copy the path of a .desktop file"
msgstr "Copier le chemin d’un fichier .desktop"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Work faster with keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Gagner du temps grâce aux raccourcis clavier"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:27
msgid "Editing an application"
msgstr "Modification d’une application"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:31
msgid "Dark style"
msgstr "Style sombre"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:36
msgid "desktop"
msgstr "bureau"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:37
msgid "launcher"
msgstr "lanceur"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:38
msgid "shortcut"
msgstr "raccourci"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:39
msgid "editor"
msgstr "éditeur"

#: data/net.dzqdzq.DesktopFilesEditor.metainfo.xml.in:63
msgid "First release."
msgstr "Première version."

